#: setzer/dialogs/document_wizard/pages/page_document_class.py:181
msgid ""
"<b>Article:</b>  For articles in scientific journals, term papers, handouts, short reports, …\n"
"\n"
"This class on its own is pretty simplistic and is often used as a starting point for more custom layouts."
msgstr ""
"<b>文章（Article）：</b>  用於科學期刊文章、學期論文、講義、短篇報告等……\n"
"\n"
"此類別本身相當簡潔，常作為自訂版面配置的起點。"

#: setzer/dialogs/document_wizard/pages/page_document_class.py:182
msgid "<b>Book:</b>  For actual books containing many chapters and sections."
msgstr "<b>書籍（Book）：</b>  用於包含許多章節的實際書籍。"

#: setzer/dialogs/document_wizard/pages/page_document_class.py:183
msgid ""
"<b>Report:</b>  For longer reports and articles containing more than one "
"chapter, small books, thesis."
msgstr "<b>報告（Report）：</b>  用於較長的報告，以及包含多章的文章、小型書籍、學位論文。"

#: setzer/dialogs/document_wizard/pages/page_document_class.py:184
msgid "<b>Letter:</b>  For writing letters."
msgstr "<b>信件（Letter）：</b>  用於撰寫信件。"

#: setzer/dialogs/document_wizard/pages/page_document_class.py:185
msgid ""
"<b>Beamer:</b>  A class for making presentation slides with LaTeX.\n"
"\n"
"There are many predefined presentation styles."
msgstr ""
"<b>Beamer：</b>  用於以 LaTeX 製作簡報投影片的類別。\n"
"\n"
"有許多預先定義的簡報樣式。"

