"Space-separated args. Use {prompt} / {file} / {cwd} as placeholders. "
"Example: aider --message {prompt} --no-auto-commits. If left blank or "
"without {prompt}, the prompt is copied to clipboard."
msgstr ""
"以空格分隔的引數。使用 {prompt} / {file} / {cwd} 作為佔位符。例如：aider --message {prompt} "
"--no-auto-commits。如果留空或不包含 {prompt}，提示資訊將複製到剪貼簿。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:199
msgid "Unavailable: install pyenchant and hunspell dictionaries to enable."
msgstr "不可用：請安裝 pyenchant 與 hunspell 詞典以啟用。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:295
