msgstr "在補齊彈出視窗中將選取往上移一項。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:297
msgid "Select next suggestion"
msgstr "選取下一個建議"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:298
